# api_land_emergency.scn — `emergency` while `land` is waiting for touchdown
#                          `land` が接地を待っている最中の `emergency`
#
# Same as api_takeoff_emergency but the blocking command is `land` (waits for IDLE_GROUND, up
# to 20 s). The `emergency` arrives 0.6 s into the descent and must cut the motors at once; the
# interrupted `land` answers "error interrupted by emergency".
# api_takeoff_emergency と同じだが、待機中のコマンドは `land`（IDLE_GROUND まで最大 20 s 待つ）。
# `emergency` は降下開始の 0.6 s 後に届き、即座にモータを止めねばならない。打ち切られた `land` は
# "error interrupted by emergency" を返す。
#
# a `takeoff` and a `left 100` arrive while `land` waits and are parked. The `emergency` must
# discard them ("error cancelled by emergency"); replaying the `takeoff` would fly the craft again
# right after the emergency.
# `land` の待機中に `takeoff` と `left 100` が届き、後回しにされる。`emergency` はそれらを
# 捨てねばならない（"error cancelled by emergency"）。`takeoff` を再生すると emergency の直後に
# 機体が再び飛ぶ。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/api_land_emergency.scn --target vehicle --duration 22000000
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz>
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50      # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    api        "command"                                          # B: enter SDK mode (t=6)
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # C: takeoff -> hover at 0.5 m
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     10000     50      # D: the takeoff finishes, hover (to t=16)
   +    api        "land"                                             # E: t=16.0 s — autonomous landing
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     300       50      # F: descending (to t=16.3)
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # parked during the wait
   +    api        "left 100"                                         # parked during the wait
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     300       50      # descending (to t=16.6)
   +    api        "emergency"                                        # G: t=16.6 s — emergency while land waits
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50      # H: motors must be stopped (to t=20.6)
